    "semantic-notes": "Semantic roles alias the primitives; see tokens.css. New in v3.0: color-link = teal-600 for AA-compliant small text. New in v3.1: color-text-signal = red-500 sanctions red as a text color (headlines, eyebrows, key stats, pull quotes); red-500 on FAFAFA is ~8.3:1, AA at any size. Red weight raised to 12-18%; red is now a co-accent, not signal-only."
  },
